m/h mean error) and over-forecast daytime highs at extended lead times. The Kenya Meteorological Department (KMD) local bulletin calls for a daytime high of 31.0°C / 88°F and low of 18.0°C / 64°F with sunny intervals in the morning and light showers likely over a few places in the afternoon, which aligns closely with the numerical multi-model consensus for afternoon and evening convective development.",
